As a matter of fact, Yugi, there is.

20
00:02:15,980 --> 00:02:21,880
It seems every time we restore peace to the
world, a greater evil is waiting for us.

21
00:02:22,260 --> 00:02:24,084
Yeah, you've got a point there.

22
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:28,677
hey look on the bright
side every battle that

23
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:31,417
we fight together also
brings us one step closer

24
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:35,857
to finding out the secrets
of your past the three

25
00:02:35,940 --> 00:02:39,577
egyptian god cards yep
they're back in our deck

26
00:02:39,660 --> 00:02:42,517
again which means it's
time to pick up where you

27
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:45,577
and i left off as soon
as we get back home we're

28
00:02:45,660 --> 00:02:48,937
going straight to that
history museum and these

29
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:51,197
three cards are going
to give us some Answers.

30
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,720
Well, let's hope.

31
00:02:55,980 --> 00:02:57,220
There he is.

32
00:02:57,920 --> 00:02:59,780
I was worried about you.

33
00:03:04,780 --> 00:03:08,480
I was even more worried
about you than Taya was.

34
00:03:08,620 --> 00:03:09,660
Thanks, I think.

35
00:03:09,940 --> 00:03:11,397
Can we get up now, please?

36
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:12,580
I can't breathe.

37
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,600
Come on, you two lovebirds.

38
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:18,680
Everyone's waiting. Let's go. Uh, sure.

39
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:20,980
But I get to hold a pantea.

40
