You know, Hawkins, for an old stuffed
shirt, you make a mean dish of pasta.

41
00:03:28,320 --> 00:03:29,150
Joey!

42
00:03:29,620 --> 00:03:33,444
There's a lot more where that came
from if you kids want to stay.

43
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:37,237
Thanks a lot, Professor, but we
should all be getting back home.

44
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:38,150
