Come on, Yugi.

60
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:22,280
Give me one good reason why we should go.

61
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:24,597
Uh, well...

62
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,060
Uh, wait, I know.

63
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:29,144
You need to get back to
help the Pharaoh, right?

64
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:31,500
I understand, dude.

65
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:35,282
Yeah, you guys have
important stuff to deal with.

66
