69
00:04:50,380 --> 00:04:51,321
Thanks, Sparrow.

70
00:04:52,460 --> 00:04:54,797
On second thought, guys,
let's stick around.

71
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:55,710
Aw, yeah.

72
00:04:55,793 --> 00:04:57,497
