78
00:05:07,460 --> 00:05:09,180
Isn't this romantic, Yugi?

79
00:05:09,940 --> 00:05:10,770
Hmm.

80
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,070
All right.

81
00:05:13,180 --> 00:05:14,917
