92
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,700
Just peachy.

93
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:44,332
Looks like we'll get some
quality time together after all.

94
00:05:45,660 --> 00:05:48,380
I wouldn't count on that short stuff

95
00:05:49,780 --> 00:05:53,080
That's Kaiba's chopper
But what's he doing here?

96
00:05:55,900 --> 00:05:58,560
Looks like you guys could use a lift Nah,

97
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:01,077
I'm sure there's tons
of taxis out here in the

98
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:03,900
middle of nowhere Wanna
fly in style with us?

99
00:06:04,260 --> 00:06:05,337
You mean it?

100
00:06:05,420 --> 00:06:07,080
I call dibs on an aisle seat

101
00:06:08,460 --> 00:06:12,317
Of course there is one catch In
exchange for the door-to-door

102
