service You'll have to enter my
brother's new dueling tournament.

103
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:17,440
New tournament?

104
00:06:19,820 --> 00:06:22,497
All right, let me fill
in a few of the details.

105
00:06:22,580 --> 00:06:25,227
Have you guys heard
about our new theme park?

106
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:27,400
Who hasn't heard about Kaiba Land?

107
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:29,357
It's only been in every newspaper.

108
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:30,270
That's true.

109
00:06:30,660 --> 00:06:32,497
Then you know it's about to open.

110
00:06:32,580 --> 00:06:35,639
And my brother wants to
kick things off with a bang.

111
00:06:38,300 --> 00:06:41,217
Thanks to that lunatic darts
and the stunt he pulled,

112
00:06:41,300 --> 00:06:43,720
Our company's reputation is shot.

113
00:06:44,780 --> 00:06:48,280
And now it's up to you
to fix it. Yes, sir.

114
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:51,040
Hey, Seto, I have an idea.

115
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:55,047
Let's plan a big event to celebrate
Kaivaland's grand opening.

116
00:06:55,400 --> 00:07:00,157
Yes, something that will grab the attention
of every news station in the country.

117
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:02,260
And I think I know what.

118
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:05,760
The ultimate tournament. That's it.

119
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:08,957
We'll gather the greatest
duelists from around the world and

120
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:11,977
