shot at the championship title.

121
00:07:12,060 --> 00:07:14,557
It'll be the biggest
thing since Battle City.

122
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:15,580
Let's hope so.

123
00:07:16,700 --> 00:07:19,800
Roland, update these
tournament contracts. Yes, sir.

124
00:07:19,980 --> 00:07:20,810
Right away.

125
00:07:20,893 --> 00:07:22,917
And if you don't mind my asking, Mr.

126
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:26,647
Kaiba, sir, what are you planning
