127
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:30,580
Call it the Kaiba Corp Grand Championship.

128
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:32,920
An excellent choice, sir.

129
00:07:33,180 --> 00:07:35,004
Let's get the show on the road.

130
00:07:35,100 --> 00:07:36,060
Good idea.

131
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:38,087
Fire up the chopper, Roland.

132
00:07:38,940 --> 00:07:42,175
