154
00:08:38,300 --> 00:08:42,065
Why don't you try opening up a
chain of amusement parks someday?

155
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:46,287
Believe me, it wasn't an easy
decision for my brother to make.

156
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:47,520
Of course not.

157
00:08:48,420 --> 00:08:51,540
Way to shoot off your big mouth. Who? Me?

158
00:08:52,560 --> 00:08:55,619
Well, maybe I did get a bit
carried away back there.

159
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:56,710
All right.

160
00:08:56,793 --> 00:09:00,740
Let's get down to business and talk
about this tournament, shall we?

161
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:05,837
We're inviting the top-ranked duelists
from every corner of the globe To battle

162
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:08,157
each other for a shot at
the world championship

163
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:11,220
title But in order for us to do that,

164
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:13,140
we need the world champ

165
00:09:14,340 --> 00:09:15,857
What do you think, Pharaoh?

166
00:09:15,940 --> 00:09:16,881
Should we do it?

167
00:09:19,660 --> 00:09:21,778
Wow, the best duelists in the world?

168
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:23,480
How could I say no?

169
00:09:23,940 --> 00:09:27,780
Mokuba, you can count
me in That is awesome!

170
00:09:28,260 --> 00:09:32,180
I knew you'd join If you get
Yugi, you're getting me, too.

171
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,900
And what about me?

172
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:37,299
I'm the youngest regional
champion to play the game.

173
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:39,820
Plus, anywhere Yugi goes, I go.

174
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:42,110
Yep.

175
00:09:42,220 --> 00:09:45,573
It just so happens I was told
to invite all three of you.

176
00:09:45,740 --> 00:09:49,940
So I have a ticket here for
Yugi, Rebecca, and Joey.

177
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:53,220
As we say in the biz, it's time to duel.

178
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:56,087
The next flight to
Kaivaland is boarding now.

179
00:10:03,020 --> 00:10:08,700
So, my dear friend Herr Kaiba is
throwing another tournament, is he?

180
00:10:08,980 --> 00:10:10,100
How charming.

181
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:15,360
Well, like I always say,
every rose has its thorn.

182
00:10:17,780 --> 00:10:18,610
So,

183
00:10:18,940 --> 00:10:20,640
you'd better be careful,

184
00:10:21,020 --> 00:10:26,280
for even the most delicate
flower can be quite dangerous.

185
00:10:26,940 --> 00:10:29,540
And I wouldn't want you to hurt yourself.

186
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,760
Leave that to me.

187
00:10:32,860 --> 00:10:34,566
Auf Wiedersehen, Herr Khyber.

188
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:44,240
Ladies and gents, welcome to Khyberland.

189
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:46,940
It's huge.

190
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:49,579
Dude, you're fogging up the window.

191
00:10:50,280 --> 00:10:53,520
We plan to open tons of
these all around the world.

192
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:56,797
Looks like they've got
every ride ever invented.

193
00:10:56,880 --> 00:10:57,710
Oh, yeah!

194
00:10:57,860 --> 00:11:00,919
I just hope they've got a
tunnel of love, don't you?

195
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:11,357
Before we get the full tour, I
gotta use the little boy's room.

196
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,793
First door on the left.

197
00:11:16,520 --> 00:11:17,580
It's blue eyes.

198
00:11:18,020 --> 00:11:19,400
That would be a statue.

199
00:11:20,940 --> 00:11:22,620
I want to cross the blue.

200
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:30,920
I thought you said the park
didn't open yet. It didn't.

201
00:11:31,060 --> 00:11:32,531
These are special guests.

202
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:37,120
Oh, and did I mention every
ride is free today? What?

203
00:11:37,300 --> 00:11:38,130
You guys run!

204
00:11:38,213 --> 00:11:39,440
I love this place.

205
00:11:39,660 --> 00:11:41,477
Let's tilt and whirl till we hurl.

206
00:11:41,560 --> 00:11:42,390
Oh, yeah.

207
00:11:42,580 --> 00:11:44,168
I need some female friends.

208
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:46,960
I saved the best part for last.

209
00:11:47,180 --> 00:11:49,280
We call that the Kaiba Dome.

210
00:11:50,640 --> 00:11:52,600
Is that a Blue Eyes arena?

211
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:55,197
We're not dealing with normal people here.

212
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:56,520
No, we're not.

213
00:11:58,200 --> 00:12:00,820
It's the world's largest indoor stadium.

214
00:12:01,160 --> 00:12:04,300
And that's the KC Dual Tech 760.

215
00:12:04,740 --> 00:12:06,140
Not too shabby.

216
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:09,478
It's our new state-of-the-art
Dual Monsters platform.

217
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:12,800
Whoa, rip that blade knife to shreds now.

218
00:12:16,740 --> 00:12:18,097
In your face.

219
00:12:18,180 --> 00:12:19,760
Revealing Magic Card.

220
00:12:20,180 --> 00:12:21,560
Activate Scapegoat.

221
