Now activating the magic
card polymerization.

233
00:13:07,580 --> 00:13:10,437
That computer did have a plan, told ya.

234
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:13,777
Now fusing together all
creatures on my side of the

235
00:13:13,860 --> 00:13:17,660
